      1
    ],
    "text": "Uncover the Hidden Secrets in Wordle Results"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000008",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0006-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0006-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0006-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0006-l0002"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0002",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0001-n0006-l0000",
      "p0001-n0006-l0001",
      "p0001-n0006-l0002"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      1
    ],
    "text": "Since Wordle has become a popular puzzle game, it has accumulated a large amount of data. In this paper, we define a series of metrics and build several models to explore the hidden information in Wordle results."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000009",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0007-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0007-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0007-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0007-l0002"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0007-l0002",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0007-l0003"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0007-l0003",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0007-l0004"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0007-l0004",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0007-l0005"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0007-l0005",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0007-l0006"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0002",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0001-n0007-l0000",
      "p0001-n0007-l0001",
      "p0001-n0007-l0002",
      "p0001-n0007-l0003",
      "p0001-n0007-l0004",
      "p0001-n0007-l0005",
      "p0001-n0007-l0006"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      1
    ],
    "text": "First, after preprocessing the given data and analyzing the time series diagram of the number of reported results, we found that the changes can be divided into 3 stages. To forecast the number of reported results, we developed a weighted optimization model based on ARIMA and BP neural network. The prediction interval is then given using the Bootstrap method. We packaged this process as ARIMA-BP Interval Prediction Model Based On Bootstrap. Thus, we finally predicted the interval prediction value obtained on March 1, 2023 at 95% confidence level to be about (19504.74, 20383.26)."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000010",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0008-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0008-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0008-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0008-l0002"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0008-l0002",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0008-l0003"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0008-l0003",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0008-l0004"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0002",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0001-n0008-l0000",
      "p0001-n0008-l0001",
      "p0001-n0008-l0002",
      "p0001-n0008-l0003",
      "p0001-n0008-l0004"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      1
    ],
    "text": "Then, we defined 3 qualitative and 4 quantitative attributes of words and used them to build a Multiple Linear Regression Model with the percentage of hard mode\u2019s players. We found that the proportion will decrease by an average of 0.618 when the initial letter changes from a vowel to a consonant while it will increase by an average of 0.017 for each one-unit increase in word internal distance."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000011",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0009-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0009-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0009-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0009-l0002"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0009-l0002",
